<title>JAPAN: NCR Japan - 1996 parent results.</title>
<headline>NCR Japan - 1996 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		101.19		vs	   55.75</p>
<p> Operating	    6.94		vs	    2.33</p>
<p> Current		6.98		vs	    1.98</p>
<p> Net	     prft 5.25		vs     loss 4.31</p>
<p> EPS	    prft 23.84 yen	  vs    loss 19.60 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p> Shares	    220 million	  vs	 220 million</p>
<p> Ord div		9.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - NCR Japan Ltd imports and sells large computers</p>
<p>produced by parent company in US. The previous figures were</p>
<p>for the six month period ending December 31, 1995, as the</p>
<p>company changed its business term.</p>
</text>
